sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 Usuario
    participant SK as 📋 Spec Kit
    participant G as 🔀 Git
    participant GH as 🌐 GitHub

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        User->>SK: specify describe
        SK->>SK: Generar spec.md
        SK->>G: [Auto-commit] Add specification
        G->>GH: Push rama feature
        GH->>GH: Create PR #1
        User->>GH: Review & Approve
        GH->>G: Merge → main
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 230)
        User->>SK: plan
        SK->>SK: Generar plan.md<br/>+ arquitectura
        SK->>G: [Auto-commit] Add plan
        G->>User: ✓ Ready for review
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 230)
        User->>SK: tasks
        SK->>SK: Generar tasks.md
        SK->>G: [Auto-commit] Add tasks
        G->>User: ✓ Ready for review
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        User->>SK: implement
        Note over SK: Ejecutando tareas...
        loop Para c/tarea
            SK->>SK: Implementar
            SK->>G: Commit cambios
        end
        SK->>G: [Auto-commit] Implementation done
        G->>GH: Push rama feature
        GH->>GH: Create PR #2
        User->>GH: Code Review
        GH->>G: Merge → main
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 240)
        Note over User,GH: ✅ COMPLETADO<br/>Feature en main
    end
